  "title": "Liberia: TotalEnergies is Awarded Four Offshore Exploration Permits",
  "summary": "Paris, September 17, 2025 – TotalEnergies has signed four Production Sharing Contracts (PSC) for the LB-6, LB-11, LB-17 and LB-29 Exploration blocks offshore Liberia, which were awarded following the 2024 Direct Negotiation Licensing Round organized by the Liberia Petroleum Regulatory Agency. The blocks LB-6, LB-11, LB-17 and LB-29, covering an area of approximately 12,700 square […]",
